                                "sense_id": "21fb7347-f8f0-3d2a-8c41-b3c1b5f6c058",
                                "text": "Not all the early autotimers were easy to use: one owner awoke at 3.00 am on Christmas morning to smell his turkey cooked and ready for eating twelve hours too soon!"
